# Git LFS rules were previously enabled for *.png and *.jpg, but
# git-lfs is not installed on the deployment targets (Vercel build
# runner, shared hosting auto-deploy). This caused committed images
# to ship as broken 131-byte LFS pointer files.
#
# PNG and JPG rules removed so new image assets commit as regular
# Git blobs and deploy correctly to all environments.
#
# Existing pointer files in /public/*.png remain as legacy pointers
# and are not used by the desktop homepage (which loads product
# images from external Google-hosted URLs).
lnkcks filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.psd filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.exe filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dll filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
